**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/ext/*
# Exception: vendored victron_ble (Unlicense / public domain).  Sourced
# from PyPI victron-ble 0.9.3 with a local cryptography-backend patch.
# See ext/victron_ble/VENDORED.md for the rationale and patch details.
# velib_python is still excluded — install.sh fetches it at runtime.
!src/opt/victronenergy/dbus-ble-sensors-py/ext/victron_ble
!src/opt/victronenergy/dbus-ble-sensors-py/ext/victron_ble/**
# Re-ignore byte-compile caches inside the vendored package (the
# !ext/victron_ble/** exception above is broad enough to allow them).
src/opt/victronenergy/dbus-ble-sensors-py/ext/victron_ble/**/__pycache__/
src/opt/victronenergy/dbus-ble-sensors-py/ext/victron_ble/**/*.pyc
# Exception: vendored victron-bluetooth-safety (Apache 2.0).  Sourced
# from TechBlueprints/victron-bluetooth-safety.  Patches vesmart-server
# to stop its 60s mass-disconnect of all BLE devices (venus#1587).
# See ext/victron-bluetooth-safety/VENDORED.md for details.
!src/opt/victronenergy/dbus-ble-sensors-py/ext/victron-bluetooth-safety
!src/opt/victronenergy/dbus-ble-sensors-py/ext/victron-bluetooth-safety/**
# Exception: BLE connection stack, carried as submodules (upstream repos).
# bleak + bleak-connection-manager (bcmv2, whose own ext/ carries the
# dbus-fast 5.x that must shadow Venus OS's site-packages 2.21.1) +
# bleak-retry-connector and its deps.  Pinned to the same commits
# dbus-easytouchrv runs on Venus OS.  install.sh inits/updates them.
!src/opt/victronenergy/dbus-ble-sensors-py/ext/aiooui
!src/opt/victronenergy/dbus-ble-sensors-py/ext/bleak
!src/opt/victronenergy/dbus-ble-sensors-py/ext/bleak-connection-manager
!src/opt/victronenergy/dbus-ble-sensors-py/ext/bleak-retry-connector
!src/opt/victronenergy/dbus-ble-sensors-py/ext/bluetooth-adapters
*.iml
.idea/
*.code-workspace
sample-driver/
.venv-test/
